        },
        {
          "id": 2004649664,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Separately, another very longstanding issue is that in addition to the I/O Graphs, which always has time in the X-axis and puts it in buckets, there really should be a separate graph dialog that allows plotting of any field vs any other field not in buckets and without summary statistics, just the values.\n\nIn a lot of ways it would be simpler than the I/O Graphs, but there are a number of use cases and issues where it would be useful.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
